# The changelog page is deliberately not translated: it includes the whole of
# CHANGELOG.md, so every past release note would become a translation unit for
# no real benefit. `sphinx-intl update` recreates this catalog anyway, so it is
# ignored rather than merely deleted -- without this it would drift back in.
# The Korean changelog page renders the English source, which is intended.
docs/manual/locale/ko/LC_MESSAGES/changelog.po

# Symlink to the shared PaleoBytes guide set (a checkout of the private devdocs
# repo). Referenced, never copied — a copy drifts from the source. See devlog 279.
.guides
